{"Title":"Order relative to authorizing the joint committee on Health Care Financing to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents relative to the health care financing matters.","BillNumber":"S2842","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"J24","Name":"Joint Committee on Health Care Financing","Type":2,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J24","ResponseDate":"2024-06-27T16:09:47.41"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S2842/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Order","Pinslip":"Senate, July 1, 2024 -- The committee on Health Care Financing, to whom was referred the Senate Bills to creating intensive stabilization and treatment units within the Department of Mental Health (Senate, No. 1268); and to non-opioid alternatives in pain treatment (Senate, No. 2786) relative to non-opioid alternatives in pain treatment report the accompanying Order (Senate, No. 2842).\r\n","DocumentText":"\tOrdered, That the committee on Health Care Financing be authorized and directed to make an investigation and study of certain current Senate documents numbered 1268 and 2786 relative to health care financing matters.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Study","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J24","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J24"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Discharge to Another Committee","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J40","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J40"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}